{"created": "2021-07-20T01:39:56.110398+00:00", "modified": "2022-06-04T02:33:42.551513+00:00", "id": 5115268, "conceptrecid": "5115267", "doi": "10.5061/dryad.n2z34tmvv", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5061/dryad.n2z34tmvv", "metadata": {"title": "The first Silurian trilobite with three-dimensionally preserved soft parts reveals novel appendage morphology", "doi": "10.5061/dryad.n2z34tmvv", "publication_date": "2021-07-21", "description": "<p>The first Silurian trilobite known with soft parts preserved, a <i>Dalmanites</i> species, is described from the Herefordshire Lagerst\u00e4tte. Biramous appendages and much of the alimentary system are evident.\u00a0 High-fidelity three-dimensional preservation reveals a novel, double arrangement of the exopod filaments, interconnected by a presumed membranous sheet. This morphology explains a misinterpretation of the exopod as supporting spiral structures, originally reported nearly 150 years ago. The new exopod morphology is considered primarily respiratory in function and comparison with other trilobite limbs suggests that it may be unique to Phacopida.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Sutton, Mark", "affiliation": "Imperial College London", "orcid": "0000-0002-7137-7572"}, {"name": "Siveter, Derek", "affiliation": "University of Oxford", "orcid": "0000-0002-5305-2192"}, {"name": "Fortey, Richard", "affiliation": "Natural History Museum"}, {"name": "Briggs, Derek", "affiliation": "Yale University"}, {"name": "Siveter, David", "affiliation": "University of Leicester"}], "keywords": ["Trilobita", "appendages", "soft-part morphology", "Herefordshire Lagerst\u00e4tte"], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-zero"}, "communities": [{"id": "dryad"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "5115267"}}]}, "notes": "<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>This dataset includes 6 zip files.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>AppendageDetail_VAXML.zip contains a detailed VAXML 3D model for appendage 5.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>Dalmanites_sp_VAXML.zip contains a VAXML 3D model for the entire specimen, OUMNH C.29611</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>Section1-Cephalon.zip, Section2-AnteriorThorax.zip, Section3-PosteriorThorax.zip and Section4-Thorax-Pygidium.zip contain between them all tomograms ('slice images') for the specimen OUMNH C.29611. Tomograms are registered but otherwise unprocessed.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>3D models are in VAXML/STL format. VAXML is an open metadata format for a combininng a series of 3D geometry files stored in the readily viewable STL format.\u00a0 See\u00a0https://spiers-software.org/ for freely available viewing software for VAXML datasets, and for further information.</p>\n<p>Funding provided by: Natural Environment Research Council<br>Crossref Funder Registry ID: http://dx.doi.org/10.13039/501100000270<br>Award Number: NE/F018037/1</p><p>Funding provided by: Leverhulme Trust<br>Crossref Funder Registry ID: http://dx.doi.org/10.13039/501100000275<br>Award Number: EM-2014-068</p>"}, "title": "The first Silurian trilobite with three-dimensionally preserved soft parts reveals novel appendage morphology", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/5115268", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/5115268", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/5115268?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5061/dryad.n2z34tmvv", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5061/dryad.n2z34tmvv", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5061/dryad.n2z34tmvv", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/5115268/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/5115267", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/5115267", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:5115268/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:5115268/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/5115268/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/5115268/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/5115268/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/5115268/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/5115268/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/5115268/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/5115268/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/5115268/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/5115268/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/5115268/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/5115268/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/5115268/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/5115268/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/5115268/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/5115268/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/5115268/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/5115268/requests"}, "updated": "2022-06-04T02:33:42.551513+00:00", "recid": "5115268", "revision": 4, "files": [{"id": "56954d89-5f56-42c7-b806-4d079a2de7ed", "key": "Section2-AnteriorThorax.zip", "size": 589306960, "checksum": "md5:54d287